{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0c59ff54-8b5a-40fa-b0c7-6d0d6b327cbd",
    "name": "厂家字典接口（wk-customer-pricing）",
    "description": "厂家字典 6 个接口的 Postman 集合，与《docs/api/manufacturer/厂家接口对接文档.md》同步维护。\n\n**使用说明**\n\n1. 先在集合 Variables 中按环境修改 `baseUrl`（默认 `http://localhost:8031`）；\n2. 鉴权已统一预置：集合级 Authorization 头直接携带裸 token（无 Bearer 前缀），取变量 `{{token}}`，全部请求自动继承；token 过期（401/无权限）时，只需在集合 Variables 中替换 `token` 一个变量；\n3. 每个请求已内置测试脚本：断言 HTTP 200 且 `code=00000000`；\n4. 建议顺序：新增 → 列表 → 重命名 → 停用/启用 → 删除。\n\n业务规则速记：编码 M+4位系统生成不可传参；中文名精确唯一；停用只影响下拉可见性；删除为逻辑删除（型号关联校验待型号模块）。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "Authorization",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 厂家列表（含停用）",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/manufacturer/list?keyword=man",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "web",
            "manufacturer",
            "list"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "keyword",
              "value": "man",
              "description": "关键词：编码/中文名/英文名，不区分大小写；不传返回全量"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "后台字典维护视图：全量厂家（含停用，置灰标识），按编码升序，平铺列表。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test(\"业务成功 code=00000000\", function () {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(\"00000000\");",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
